      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this exceptional Architecturally designed detached family home, enjoying a superb location on the fringes of the thriving coastal town of Dungarvan. This impeccably presented residence offers a perfect opportunity for a purchaser to acquire a fabulous turnkey home. From the moment you step inside, the impeccable presentation, high-specification finishes and tasteful dcor are immediately apparent. Bright, generously proportioned accommodation, flooded with natural light has been carefully planned to provide the perfect balance of elegance and practicality for modern family living. The beautifully landscaped front and rear gardens provide the perfect outdoor space while the meticulously landscaped south-facing enclosed rear garden provides a private sanctuary for year-round enjoyment with the magnificent sun-drenched terrace making the ideal setting for al fresco dining, entertaining family and friends or simply relaxing in peaceful surroundings. A substantial double garage further enhances the property's appeal, providing secure parking, excellent storage and exceptional versatility. Combining an enviable location just minutes from Dungarvan Town Centre with numerous amenities to include schools, shops, pubs, restaurants, beaches, sporting facilities, with generous accommodation, exceptional finishes and beautifully designed outdoor living spaces, this is a truly outstanding family home that is sure to impress even the most discerning purchaser. Convenient access to the N25/N72 makes this location an excellent choice for commuters. The spacious accommodation extending to 324 sq.m comprises, Entrance Hallway, Lounge, Sunroom, Stairs to Gallery Landing, Livingroom, Office, Kitchen/Diner, 2 Bedrooms, Dressing Room, Bathroom, First Floor Landing, 2 Ensuite Bedrooms. External Utility, Double Garage. Properties of this calibre rarely come to the market and REA Spratt highly recommend viewing. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n1.46m x 0.76m Bright spacious hallway, extensive tiling, wall lights, recessed lighting.\n\nLounge\n6.40m x 4.67m Detailed marble fireplace, marble hearth, solid woodburning stove, timber flooring, built in shelving, gallery landing overhead\n\nSunroom\n4.60m x 4.50m Overlooking sun terrace and enclosed garden.\n\nSitting Room\n4.80m x 4.58m\nMeasurement excludes Bay Coving, detailed marble fireplace, marble hearth, double doors to office.\n\nOffice\n3.65m x 3.30m Timber flooring, recessed lighting\n\nKitchen/Dining\n6.60m x 4.56m Floor Eye level units, Island unit, integrated dishwasher, oven, hob, microwave, French doors to South facing terrace.\n\nLanding\n5.70m x 2.40m Timber flooring, recessed lighting, velux windows\n\nBedroom 1\n4.24m x 3.72m Timber flooring, front aspect\n\nDressing Room\n5.35m x 3.00m\nMeasurement excludes built in wardrobes Timber flooring\n\nBedroom 2\n4.56m x 4.12m French doors to south facing terrace, timber flooring.\n\nBathroom\n3.47m x 1.80m Fully tiled, jacuzzi bath, Mira Elite 2 electric shower, window provides for natural ventilation.\n\nBedroom 3\n4.90m x 4.43m\nMeasurement excludes built in wardrobes Ensuite off\n\nEn-suite\n3.50m x 2.20m Jacuzzi bath, power shower, storage off, double vanity unit, fully tiled, window provides for natural ventilation.\n\nBedroom 4\n5.40m x 4.87m Carpet, velux window, slide robes, Ensuite off\n\nEn-suite\n5.40m x 4.87m Carpet, slide robes, ensuite off velux window\n\nUtility Room\n7.50m x 5.30m Fully tiled, up and over door, plumbed for washing machine, Plant room off\n\nGarage\n18.46m x 3.90m Double Garage Measuring Up and over door to the front, double doors to the rear.\n\n\nOutside\n-Substantial double Garage with up and over door to the front and double doors to the rear and pedestrian door to the side. -Utility having plant room off -Landscaped front and private south facing rear gardens -Covered BBQ area with seating"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
