        "Content": "-Elegant family home offering a purchaser a turnkey purchase\n-Quality fixtures & Fittings throughout\n-Within a walk of Dungarvan Town Centre and its numerous amenities\n-ideal commuter base having easy access to N25/N72\n\n\nAll light fittings, window furnishings, floor coverings, integrated appliances \n All main services to include mains water and mains sewerage\nEV Charger and PV solar panels\nOFCH\nSecurity alarm system\n \n Numerous amenities of Dungarvan Town on the doorstep."
